 subject="""comment 1"""
 date="2026-09-24T14:15:47Z"
 content="""
When this was filed in 2020 I'm not sure why it would do that,
but later on [[!commit ba7ecbc6a9c3763e8152e4f46522d14a4ee2b59d]]
made `quiesce` call `Database.Keys.closeDb` and so this is entirely the
expected behavior.

There is certainly the potential for less frequent use of `quiesce`
avoiding this overhead though. It could eg wait 1 second after last
use before quiescing.
"""]]
